<div id="content" class="col span_10 clr span_content">

<article class="post single-post-content">
		
	<div class="post-title-outer">
		<div class="post-meta post-date">
			<span class="month">Aug</span>
			<span class="day">12</span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="post-title"><a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" rel="bookmark">Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole</a></h1>
		<div class="post-meta">
			<span class="post-cats">
				<a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/category/recipes/appetizers-snacks/" rel="category tag">Appetizers &amp; Snacks</a>, <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/category/recipes/cinco-de-mayo/" rel="category tag">Cinco de Mayo</a>, <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/category/recipes/appetizers-snacks/guacamole/" rel="category tag">guacamole</a>, <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/category/recipes/easy-recipes/" rel="category tag">Quick &amp; Easy</a>, <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/category/recipes/" rel="category tag">Recipes</a>			</span>
			<span class="spacer">//</span> <span class="ccount"><a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/#comments">3 Comments</a></span>
		</div>
	</div>
 	
	<div class="post-content">
		<input class="jpibfi" type="hidden"><p>Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole is inspired by the guacamole from Honchos &#8211; a local restaurant in Clarkston, Michigan. In my version, sweet peas, roasted serrano peppers and cilantro are combined with green onions, avocado and fresh lime juice and is topped with Mexicali spiced pepitas. Yields 2 cups.</p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126985" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-700x1049.jpg" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></p>
<h4>One of my favorite places to meet friends for lunch is Honcho.</h4>
<p>It&#8217;s a super cute restaurant in Clarkston, Michigan that has the best coffee, cocktails and house-made cinnamon sugar doughnuts (iykyk). When I&#8217;m there I always order <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/honcho-chop-salad/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the chop salad</a> with chicken and get the sweet pea guacamole and chips as well. The salad is perfection and the guac is flavorful and addictive, which is why I decided to recreate a version at home.</p>
<p>I&#8217;m not exactly sure how the folks at Honcho make theirs, but I decided to add roasted serrano peppers for a little heat that I think pairs really well with the sweet pea/cilantro and avocado mash.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126987" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126987" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-700x1049.jpg" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-154.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Get your tortilla chips ready!</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126992" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Ingredients for Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126992" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-700x1049.jpg" alt="Ingredients for Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-155.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<h3>To Make This Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole You Will Need:</h3>
<p><em>for the pepitas:</em></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>pepitas</strong> &#8211;  <i>Use raw and unsalted, shellled pumpkin seeds.</i></li>
<li><b>lime juice</b> (freshly squeezed) &#8211; <em>Adds flavor and helps adhere the spice blend to the pepitas.</em></li>
<li><a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/mexicali-seasoning/"><strong>mexicali seasoning</strong></a> &#8211; <em>A flavorful homemade blend of cilantro, chili powder, cumin, chipotle, cilantro, oregano, garlic and onion powder.</em></li>
<li><b>kosher salt</b> &#8211; <i>Enhances the flavors in the spiced pepitas.</i></li>
</ul>
<p><i>for the guacamole:</i></p>
<ul>
<li><b>serrano peppers</b> &#8211; <i>Or substitute with jalapeños.</i></li>
<li><b>avocado oil spray </b>&#8211; <i>This helps develop the char on the outside of the pepper.</i></li>
<li><b>english peas</b> &#8211; <i>Cooked (steamed) if fresh or thawed if frozen.</i></li>
<li><b>cilantro</b> &#8211; <em>Lends a pop of bright herbaceous freshness.</em></li>
<li><b>avocados</b> &#8211; <i>I use 3 good size avocados. Double if using smaller avocados.</i></li>
<li><strong>green onion</strong> &#8211; Adds <em>a mild yet bright onion flavor.</em></li>
<li><b>lime juice</b> &#8211; <em>Adds acidity and will enhance the flavors in the guacamole.</em></li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126993" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="thawed sweet peas" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126993" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-700x1049.jpg" alt="thawed sweet peas" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-156.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<p>To make this recipe you will need 1 cup cooked English peas which are also known as sweet peas or garden peas. You can use 6 ounces fresh peas or use 1 cup thawed (previously frozen) peas.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126994" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="pepitas and seasoning in skillet" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126994" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-700x1049.jpg" alt="pepitas and seasoning in skillet" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-157.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<h4>Make the Spiced Pepitas:</h4>
<p>In a small nonstick skillet, measure and add 1/2 cup pepitas, 1-1/2 teaspoons Mexicali seasoning, a pinch of kosher salt and the juice from 1/2 a lime.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126995" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="toasted seasoned pepitas" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126995" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-700x1049.jpg" alt="toasted seasoned pepitas" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-158.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Stir to coat and heat over medium on your stovetop, stirring often for 3 to 4 minutes.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126998" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="roasted serrano peppers" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-126998" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-700x1049.jpg" alt="roasted serrano peppers" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-159.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<h4>Roast the Serrano Peppers:</h4>
<p>Preheat your ovens broiler and arrange your oven rack so that it is 4 to 6 inches away from the heating element. Line a metal baking sheet with foil and add the peppers. Slide under the broiler and broil for 4 to 8 minutes or until charred all over, turn the peppers halfway through to ensure even charring. Watch carefully!</p>
<p>After the peppers are charred, pop them into a bowl and cover with plastic wrap. This allows the steam to work it&#8217;s way out, separating the skin from the flesh. Once safe to handle, remove the stems, peel the skin and remove the seeds and ribs.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127000" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="add peas, cilantro and prepped roasted Serrano peppers" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127000" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-700x1049.jpg" alt="add peas, cilantro and prepped roasted Serrano peppers" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-160.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<h4>Make the Guacamole:</h4>
<p>In a mini food processor (I&#8217;ve linked mine in the recipe printable), measure and add 1 cup (cooked or thawed) sweet peas, cilantro (measure with your heart!), the roasted (skinned and seeded) serrano peppers.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127002" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="pulse to finely chop" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127002" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-700x1049.jpg" alt="pulse to finely chop" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-161.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Secure the lid and pulse to combine. It should be somewhat smooth but still a little chunky.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127004" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="add avocados, pea and Serrano mixture, green onion, lime juice and salt" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127004" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-700x1049.jpg" alt="add avocados, pea and Serrano mixture, green onion, lime juice and salt" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-163.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<p>In a bowl, add 3 good size avocados, the pea mixture, 3 chopped green onions, juice of 1/2 a lime and a pinch or two of kosher salt. I like to use potato masher to smash the avocados and combine the ingredients.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127007" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="mash to combine" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127007" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-700x1049.jpg" alt="mash to combine" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-164.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Taste and add more salt or lime juice to taste.</p>
<p>The color&#x1f60d;</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127008" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127008" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-700x1049.jpg" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-165.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Transfer to a bowl and top with the spiced pepitas (keeping any extra on the side to add more as needed) and serve with your favorite tortilla chips. I like either these <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/baked-lime-tortilla-chips/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">salty lime homemade chips</a> or the La Fiesta brand (not sponsored). <strong>Or</strong> add to your favorite <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/category/recipes/main-entrees/tacos-main-dish/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tacos</a>, <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/?s=fajitas" target="_blank" rel="noopener">fajitas</a> or <a href="https://www.simplyscratch.com/?s=mexican+rice+bowls" target="_blank" rel="noopener">skillets and rice bowls</a>!</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127010" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127010" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-700x1049.jpg" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-166.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
