<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127014" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20700%201049'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-700x1049.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1.jpg 1400w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" data-lazy-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-700x1049.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-127014" src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-700x1049.jpg" alt="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" width="700" height="1049" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.simplyscratch.com/serrano-sweet-pea-guacamole/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Serrano Sweet Pea Guacamole" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-700x1049.jpg" srcset="https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-700x1049.jpg 700w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-410x614.jpg 410w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1-1367x2048.jpg 1367w, https://www.simplyscratch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Image-153-1.jpg 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></noscript></p>
<div id="recipe"></div><div id="wprm-recipe-container-111324" class="wprm-recipe-container" data-recipe-id="111324" data-servings="8"><div class="wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-custom"><div class="wprm-recipe-head">
